<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle trade steady at $64 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle trade steady at $64 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade moderate Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers steady.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported good inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>Sales reported on 13,700 slaughter steers and 6,600 heifers following weekly movement of 94,100.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1250 lbs $64.00, pen North Plains $64.25.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers Select and Choice 2-3 1000-1150 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed 20,300  Last Week 0 Year Ago 800.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
